1. Structurally Novel Chemical Scaffold

The compound represents a previously unreported heteroatom arrangement within an adamantane-topology cage:

6 ring nitrogens

4 ring carbons

All six nitrogens are substituted with N-nitro (nitramine) groups

Known cage compounds typically feature:

All-carbon frameworks (adamantane derivatives), or

Fully nitrogen frameworks (polyazacages), or

Partial substitution with carbon-bound nitro groups

A mixed C/N cage with full N-functionalization is structurally distinct from known classes.

Patent relevance:

Novel molecular architecture (35 U.S.C. §102 / EPC Art. 54)

